        "text": "Amazon Elastic Beanstalk\nAmazon offers the Elastic Beanstalk service, whose interface is straightforward. You can create a\nsample application or upload your own, and Beanstalk takes care of the rest, from deployment details\nto load balancing, scaling, and monitoring. You select the AWS EC2 hardware instances to deploy on.\nNext, we will discuss another major player\u2019s offering: Google App Engine .\nShort Introduction to Cloud Computing\n512",
